{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Cholinergic patterns correlate with dopamine medication ON freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40512756\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"§4.3将14例胆碱能PET研究引用为PMID:40635563。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"PMID:40635563实际对应另一篇文献Disease-Modifying Trials in Treated Parkinson's Disease: Stable Treated Does Not Equate with Biological Stability，并非胆碱能PET研究。该胆碱能PET研究的正确PMID是40512756。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Thenaisie等，2022年，PD患者STN神经活动与步态冻结（FOG）研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"36070366\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"§5.1称研究纳入4名PD患者，并进一步称该研究样本只有4人。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原研究总体纳入18名患者，其中12名参加步态实验，只有4名在实验中实际发生冻结事件。4人是发生FOG的事件亚组，而不是整个研究的样本量。报告将FOG事件亚组人数描述为研究整体样本量，造成研究规模误解。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Zhang等，2025年，PMC-STN/M1-STN coherence与冻结步态研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"§5.7认为论文内部部分统计结果与图注的方向报告存在不一致。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原论文定义的百分比变化为(Walk-Turn)/Walk，因此正系数可能表示转弯期相对于行走基线的下降。图注中PMC-STN coherence增加与较短冻结持续时间相关的描述，可能与该归一化方向相容，并不必然构成统计方向矛盾。报告可能没有结合原论文公式及系数符号正确解释统计结果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Beta-burst驱动的自适应DBS研究（预印本与正式发表版本）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40677701\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1101/2024.06.26.24309418\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将DOI:10.1101/2024.06.26.24309418和PMID:40677701分别列入参考文献表及证据表，建立两个独立Evidence ID，并同时用于C6和C12的证据支持。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"这两个文献记录实际上是同一项beta-burst驱动自适应DBS研究的预印本和正式发表版本，使用同一研究队列，并非两项独立研究。报告没有建立明确的版本关联，若将其作为独立证据计数，会重复计算同一研究，夸大独立研究的数量和重复验证程度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:42571859，步态周期锁定的皮层低频活动、S1-STN theta coherence及不同刺激条件研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"42571859\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在结构化证据关联中将该研究关联至C6（STN beta burst时间结构相关机制）。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原研究主要提供步态周期锁定的皮层低beta活动和皮层-STN theta coherence证据，并研究HFS、LFS对相关活动及冻结的调节，并非直接研究STN beta burst持续时间。该研究可以支持步态相位调制机制，但不宜不加区分地作为STN beta burst机制的直接证据。其与C2（刺激频率）和C8（皮层-STN耦合）也有直接关联。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73ac32fc-d7f7-4f06-93a2-c634cfbc49d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114018992166Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:41:12.126776+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a40e471d831ff5f6cddf8664249b9ab527313af5120541b6cda452e722abe5c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114018992166Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "cb1451fd66ab7c6a5e2f007e8f4abacd929e292bbf02b53fb878d212c3e8c224"}}}
